    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/bea0664bb9e2990d64c86ca1f7cb94f8.poster.avif?t=1752854551\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/bea0664bb9e2990d64c86ca1f7cb94f8.webm?t=1752854551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/bea0664bb9e2990d64c86ca1f7cb94f8.mp4?t=1752854551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poly TD is a new type of tower defense game with roguelike elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine heroes in a circular stage and use your own strategy to fend off endless waves of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine Heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/23f620cd464452bc3c106e38d8d89c81.poster.avif?t=1752854551\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/23f620cd464452bc3c106e38d8d89c81.webm?t=1752854551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/23f620cd464452bc3c106e38d8d89c81.mp4?t=1752854551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine heroes according to the rules of combinatorics to create even more powerful heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary heroes wield overwhelming power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/e5de4bb0453d94936f91c05a50c674db.poster.avif?t=1752854551\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/e5de4bb0453d94936f91c05a50c674db.webm?t=1752854551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/e5de4bb0453d94936f91c05a50c674db.mp4?t=1752854551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your luck in the Shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain powerful weapons and rare relics to make your heroes even stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/f9259d35ee315100e4b59c90047b02dd.poster.avif?t=1752854551\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/f9259d35ee315100e4b59c90047b02dd.webm?t=1752854551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/f9259d35ee315100e4b59c90047b02dd.mp4?t=1752854551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your heroes with items to enhance their abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choosing the right item combination is the key to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, are you ready to find the best combinations and fend off the enemy invasion?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/bea0664bb9e2990d64c86ca1f7cb94f8.poster.avif?t=1752854551\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/bea0664bb9e2990d64c86ca1f7cb94f8.webm?t=1752854551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/bea0664bb9e2990d64c86ca1f7cb94f8.mp4?t=1752854551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poly TD is a new type of tower defense game with roguelike elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine heroes in a circular stage and use your own strategy to fend off endless waves of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine Heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/23f620cd464452bc3c106e38d8d89c81.poster.avif?t=1752854551\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/23f620cd464452bc3c106e38d8d89c81.webm?t=1752854551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/23f620cd464452bc3c106e38d8d89c81.mp4?t=1752854551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine heroes according to the rules of combinatorics to create even more powerful heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary heroes wield overwhelming power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/e5de4bb0453d94936f91c05a50c674db.poster.avif?t=1752854551\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/e5de4bb0453d94936f91c05a50c674db.webm?t=1752854551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/e5de4bb0453d94936f91c05a50c674db.mp4?t=1752854551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your luck in the Shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain powerful weapons and rare relics to make your heroes even stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/f9259d35ee315100e4b59c90047b02dd.poster.avif?t=1752854551\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/f9259d35ee315100e4b59c90047b02dd.webm?t=1752854551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871390/extras/f9259d35ee315100e4b59c90047b02dd.mp4?t=1752854551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your heroes with items to enhance their abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choosing the right item combination is the key to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, are you ready to find the best combinations and fend off the enemy invasion?</p>",
